#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:227
msgid "Showcase"
msgstr "Pameran"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:228
msgid ""
"Full-width interactive section on the homepage. Each book is the same card "
"used in Latest Publications; the blurred backdrop crossfades to the "
"highlighted book's cover. Only books with a featured image appear, and books"
" shown here are excluded from the Latest Publications grid below it."
msgstr ""
"Bahagian interaktif lebar penuh pada laman utama. Setiap buku menggunakan "
"kad yang sama seperti dalam Terbitan Terkini; latar kabur bertukar perlahan "
"kepada kulit buku yang diserlahkan. Hanya buku yang mempunyai imej pilihan "
"dipaparkan, dan buku yang dipaparkan di sini dikecualikan daripada grid "
"Terbitan Terkini di bawahnya."

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:233
msgid "Enable the Showcase section"
msgstr "Dayakan bahagian Pameran"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:235
msgid ""
"The section hides itself automatically when fewer than 2 matching books have"
" featured images."
msgstr ""
"Bahagian ini tersembunyi secara automatik apabila kurang daripada 2 buku "
"yang sepadan mempunyai imej pilihan."

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:239
msgid "Section Heading"
