#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:491
msgid "Agent Tools (WebMCP)"
msgstr "Alat Ejen (WebMCP)"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:492
msgid ""
"Lets in-browser AI agents search the catalogue and look up books through two"
" read-only tools, and fill in (never send) the contact form. Browsers "
"without WebMCP ignore all of it. As of 2026 the API is behind Origin Trials "
"in Chrome and Edge and supported in Brave Leo and ChatGPT Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Membolehkan ejen AI dalam pelayar mencari katalog dan mendapatkan maklumat "
"buku melalui dua alat baca sahaja, serta mengisi (tetapi tidak menghantar) "
"borang hubungan. Pelayar tanpa WebMCP mengabaikan kesemuanya. Setakat 2026, "
"API ini masih dalam Percubaan Asal (Origin Trials) di Chrome dan Edge serta "
"disokong dalam Brave Leo dan ChatGPT Desktop."

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:497
msgid "Enable agent tools"
msgstr "Dayakan alat ejen"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:499
msgid ""
"Registers search-publications and get-publication, and exposes a public "
"read-only endpoint at /wp-json/langgam-fikir/v1/publications."
msgstr ""
"Mendaftarkan search-publications dan get-publication, serta mendedahkan "
"titik akhir awam baca sahaja di /wp-json/langgam-fikir/v1/publications."

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:505
msgid "Let agents fill in the contact form"
msgstr "Benarkan ejen mengisi borang hubungan"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:507
msgid ""
"Adds tool attributes to the contact form. Agents can complete the fields but"
" sending always requires the visitor to press the button."
msgstr ""
"Menambah atribut alat pada borang hubungan. Ejen boleh melengkapkan medan, "
"tetapi penghantaran sentiasa memerlukan pelawat menekan butang."

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:511
msgid "Origin Trial Token"
msgstr "Token Percubaan Asal"

#: inc/admin/theme-options.php:513
msgid ""
"Optional. Paste the token from the Chrome or Edge Origin Trials console to "
"test WebMCP in those browsers. Emitted as a meta http-equiv=\"origin-trial\""
" tag. Tokens are tied to this domain and expire."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan. Tampal token daripada konsol Origin Trials Chrome atau Edge untuk "
"menguji WebMCP dalam pelayar tersebut. Dikeluarkan sebagai tag meta http-"
"equiv=\"origin-trial\". Token terikat pada domain ini dan tamat tempoh."

