#: inc/options-schema.php:211
msgid ""
"Langgam Fikir is an independent publishing house dedicated to bringing "
"profound narratives and critical thought to the forefront of the Malaysian "
"literary scene."
msgstr ""
"Langgam Fikir ialah rumah penerbitan bebas yang berdedikasi membawa naratif "
"mendalam dan pemikiran kritis ke barisan hadapan dunia sastera Malaysia."

