#: inc/options-schema.php:356
msgid ""
"The \"page not found\" screen: a bookshelf with a gap, one random quip, a "
"message and a few books to try instead."
msgstr ""
"Skrin \"halaman tidak ditemui\": rak buku yang berlompang, satu gurauan "
"rawak, satu mesej dan beberapa buku untuk dicuba."

#: inc/options-schema.php:358
msgid "This page has wandered off the shelf."
msgstr "Halaman ini telah merayau keluar dari rak."

#: inc/options-schema.php:359
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Mesej"

#: inc/options-schema.php:359
msgid ""
"We looked under every cover, behind the footnotes and between the lines. Nothing.\n"
"\n"
"The page you wanted may have moved, been renamed, or never existed outside someone's imagination (which, to be fair, is where most good books begin)."
msgstr ""
"Kami telah mencari di bawah setiap kulit, di sebalik nota kaki dan di antara baris. Tiada.\n"
"\n"
"Halaman yang anda cari mungkin telah berpindah, ditukar nama, atau tidak pernah wujud di luar imaginasi seseorang (yang, sejujurnya, ialah tempat bermulanya kebanyakan buku yang baik)."

#: inc/options-schema.php:360
msgid "Quips"
msgstr "Gurauan"

#: inc/options-schema.php:360
msgid ""
"Misshelved, not lost. Probably.\n"
"Even the best index misses an entry.\n"
"This chapter has been left intentionally blank.\n"
"Plot twist: the link was broken all along.\n"
"The author is as surprised as you are.\n"
"Our editors have been notified. They are pretending to be shocked.\n"
"It was here a minute ago. We checked the margins."
msgstr ""
"Tersalah letak, bukan hilang. Mungkin.\n"
"Indeks terbaik pun terlepas satu entri.\n"
"Bab ini sengaja dibiarkan kosong.\n"
"Pusingan cerita: pautan ini memang sudah rosak sejak awal.\n"
"Penulis sama terkejutnya dengan anda.\n"
"Para penyunting kami telah dimaklumkan. Mereka berpura-pura terkejut.\n"
"Tadi ada di sini. Kami sudah semak tepi halaman."

#: inc/options-schema.php:360
msgid ""
"One per line. A different one is shown at random each time. Empty hides it."
msgstr ""
"Satu baris satu gurauan. Gurauan berbeza dipaparkan secara rawak setiap "
"kali. Kosong menyembunyikannya."

